Part 2: physics collision, damage, turn, win/lose, update loop, particles. Then part 3 render/draw methods.

Let's append. Need an anchor at end of file. I'll use edit with oldString the last lines of triggerAbility. Add methods.

Part 2 content:

- onCollisions
- collideOne
- damageBlock
- breakBlock
- explodeTnt
- explode
- defeatBird
- rescueEgg
- removeBody / processRemovals
- wake? no
- finishTurn / afterTurn / maybeLose / checkWin / finishLevel / showLose / pause / resume
- update(dt)
- frame
- resize
- particle spawn helpers (spawnDust, spawnFeathers, spawnDebris, spawnConfetti, spawnSparkles)

Let's write.

Details:

`onCollisions(e)`:
```
const now=performance.now();
for pair:
 const a,b; speed...
 if (!a.game && !b.game) continue;
 if (speed > 2) {
   this.collideOne(a,b,speed);
   this.collideOne(b,a,speed);
 }
 if (speed>8.5 && now-this.lastThud>90) { ... audio.thud; shake...; spawn dust at midpoint }
```
Careful: `collideOne` for egg might rescue on ground collision after falling. Good.

`collideOne(target, other, speed)`:
```
const g=target.game; if(!g||g.dead) return;
const otherKind=other.game?.kind;
if (g.kind==='bird') {
  if (speed>6.2 || (otherKind==='pig' && speed>2.0) || (otherKind==='tnt' && speed>1)) this.defeatBird(target);
  return;
}
if (g.kind==='block') {
  if (speed>3.1) {
    const m = other.isStatic ? 7 : Math.min(other.mass || 2, 14);
    this.damageBlock(target, (speed-2.2)*m*1.55, other.position);
  }
  return;
}
if (g.kind==='tnt') {
  if (speed>2.1) this.explodeTnt(target);
  return;
}
if (g.kind==='egg') {
  if (speed>1.35 && otherKind!=='egg') this.rescueEgg(target);
  return;
}
if (g.kind==='pig' && speed>12) { small dust; }
```
For bird hit by ground at speed>6.2 -> defeat. Good. Bird hit by block speed 5 not dead; okay.

`damageBlock(body, amount, from)`:
```
if dead return;
body.game.hp -= amount; body.game.flash = 1;
if (Math.random()<.35) spawnDust(...)
if (hp<=0) breakBlock(body)
```
`breakBlock`:
```
g.dead=true; removeBody;
const mat=MATERIALS[g.material];
this.addScore(mat.score, pos.x, pos.y, `+${mat.score}`, '#ffe9bd');
spawnDebris; sound; shake
```
`removeBody`: if already dead? set? It pushes to toRemove; also set body.game.dead true externally. We can have removeBody push if not already removed.
```
if (this.toRemove.includes(body)) return;
this.toRemove.push(body);
```
Process after steps.

`explodeTnt(body)`: if dead return; dead=true; removeBody; addScore(100,...); explode; audio; etc. Chain handled by explode for other tnts.

`explode(x,y,radius,power,source)`:
```
this.audio.explode(); shake 24;
spawn ring + smoke + sparks
const bodies = Composite.allBodies(world);
for (const b of bodies) {
 if (b===source || b.isStatic || !b.game) continue;
 const d = Math.hypot...
 if (d > radius) continue;
 const f = 1 - d/radius;
 const nx=(b.position.x-x)/(d||1), ny=...
 Body.setVelocity(b,{x:b.velocity.x+nx*16*f*power, y:b.velocity.y+ny*16*f*power - 4*f});
 if (b.game.kind==='block') damageBlock(b, 190*f*power, {x,y});
 else if bird -> defeatBird
 else if tnt -> setTimeout(explodeTnt, 60+...)
 else if egg -> rescueEgg
 else if pig -> maybe nothing
}
```
Note source pig already removed? We call removeBody(b) after explode in triggerAbility; during explode source is still in world and skipped. Good.
TNT chain: `setTimeout(() => this.explodeTnt(b), 70 + Math.random()*70)` but if level ends/cleared, guard b.game.dead and this.engine. Fine.

`defeatBird(body)`:
```
if dead return; g.dead=true; removeBody;
this.addScore(500, x,y-20, '+500', '#ffd6c7');
spawnFeathers; audio.poof(); shake 6;
this.checkWin();
```
Maybe add slow-mo? checkWin handles last.
`checkWin`:
```
if (state!=='playing'||winPending) return;
if (!this.birds || this.birds.some(b=>!b.game.dead)) return;
winPending=true;
hideAbilityHint();
timeScale=0.28; slowmoUntil=performance.now()+900;
shake=12;
setTimeout(()=>{ if(this.state==='playing'||this.state==='paused') {this.timeScale=1; this.finishLevel();} },1500);
```
But state stays 'playing' until finish. If user pauses during slowmo? unlikely. finishLevel guard.

`finishLevel`:
```
if (state==='win') return;
this.state='win';
this.timeScale=1;
const unused=this.queue.length;
const bonus=500+unused*1000;
if (bonus) this.score+=bonus; // no popup
const stars...
save best/stars
updateHud
dom winScore text
dom winBest
dom winEgg class hidden...
winStars children classes
showOnly(win); showHUD(true); winStars.classList.remove('show'); setTimeout add show and audio star per star
spawnConfetti
audio.win
```
Note win screen uses stars set before class show. Good.
`this.dom.nextBtn` label maybe if last: text "LEVELS". We can leave.

`pause`: if state playing → paused; showOnly(pause); hud true; hide hint; audio maybe.
`resume`: state playing; showOnly(null); hud true.
`showLose`: state lose; showOnly(lose); hud true; audio.lose; tip.
`afterTurn`:
```
if (this.state!=='playing' || this.winPending) return;
if (this.queue.length) this.loadNextPig();
else this.maybeLose();
```
`finishTurn`:
```
if (this.turnEnding) return;
this.turnEnding=true;
this.activePig=null;
this.hideAbilityHint();
if (this.activePig) ... // keep body
setTimeout(()=>{ this.turnEnding=false; this.afterTurn(); }, 420);
```
But we set activePig null; body remains spent. Mark body.game.spent=true.
Need if pig went off world: remove body. In update check.

`maybeLose`:
```
if (losePending || winPending) return;
if (this.birds.some(b=>!b.game.dead)) { losePending=true; setTimeout(()=>{ if(this.state==='playing'&&!this.winPending) this.showLose(); }, 900); }
```
But if win occurs during that 900ms, guard.

Update:
```
frame(now) {
 const dtReal=Math.min(50, now-this.last); this.last=now;
 this.time += dtReal/1000;
 this.updateAmbient(dtReal);
 if (this.state==='playing') {
   if (now>this.slowmoUntil && this.timeScale<1) this.timeScale=1;
   this.accum += dtReal*this.timeScale;
   let steps=0;
   while(this.accum>=STEP && steps<5) { Engine.update(this.engine, STEP); this.accum-=STEP; steps++; }
   this.processRemovals();
   this.updateTurn(now, dtReal);
   this.blocks.forEach(...flash decay)
   this.tnts...
   if (this.activePig) add trail...
 }
 this.updateParticles(dtReal * (this.state==='playing' ? this.timeScale : 1));
 this.updatePopups(dtReal);
 this.shake = Math.max(0, this.shake - dtReal*0.045);
 this.render(now);
 requestAnimationFrame...
}
```
Shake decay: amplitude px; subtract dt*0.05 (50/s). shake 20 lasts 400ms. Good.

`updateTurn`:
```
if (!this.activePig || this.winPending) return;
const b=this.activePig;
const age=now-this.launchTime;
const sp=Math.hypot(b.velocity.x,b.velocity.y);
if (b.position.y>1100 || b.position.x<-250 || b.position.x>1850) { this.removeBody(b); b.game.dead=true; this.finishTurn(); return;}
if (age>850 && sp<0.55) { this.restTime += dtReal; if(this.restTime>480) this.finishTurn(); } else this.restTime=0;
if (age>9500) this.finishTurn();
```
But if bird defeat triggers winPending, we don't finish turn; fine.

`updateParticles`: life, movement. Remove expired. Cap.
`updatePopups`.

`updateAmbient`: clouds x += sp*dt; wrap at 1800 to -250.

Resize:
```
const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(); cw=rect.width...
dpr=Math.min(2,devicePixelRatio||1);
canvas.width=Math.round(cw*dpr); height...
scale=Math.min(cw/W,ch/H); ox=(cw-W*s)/2; oy=(ch-H*s)/2;
```
For portrait maybe add vertical offset? no.

Particles spawn:
- `spawnDust(x,y,count,power)` circles.
- `spawnFeathers(x,y,type)` 14 feathers in bird colors + white.
- `spawnDebris(x,y,material)` 12 rect/shard with colors.
- `spawnSparkles(x,y)` for egg.
- `spawnConfetti()` 140 from y -20..0 across world x random.
- `spawnRing(x,y,color)`.

Particle object fields: x,y,vx,vy,size,color,shape,life,maxLife,rot,vr,gravity,grow,alpha.
Update: `p.life -= dt; if <=0 remove; p.vy += p.gravity*dt; p.x += p.vx*dt; ...; p.size += p.grow*dt;`
Gravity values in px/s² (e.g., 1200). Good.

Popups update.

